c:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-14","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Detailed pricing breakdowns"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","$L2","crazy-egg-pricing",{"href":"/pricing-guides/crazy-egg-pricing","className":"group rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-fg-muted","children":"Visual analytics (heatmaps, A/B testing)"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-fg group-hover:text-accent transition-colors","children":["Crazy Egg"," Pricing"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Crazy Egg pricing starts at $49/month (Starter), with Plus at $99/month and Pro at $249/month. It provides heatmaps, recordings, and A/B testing - all of which require existing traffic. It visualizes behavior but does not diagnose conversion structure, and it needs visitor volume before it produces anything. Nebula scores the conversion structure of any URL instantly, free, with no traffic required."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-xs text-accent","children":"Read the pricing breakdown →"}]]}],["$","$L2","hotjar-pricing",{"href":"/pricing-guides/hotjar-pricing","className":"group rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-fg-muted","children":"Behavior analytics (heatmaps)"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-fg group-hover:text-accent transition-colors","children":["Hotjar"," Pricing"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Hotjar has a free tier (35 sessions per day) and paid plans from $32/month (Plus) and $80/month (Business). It shows you what visitors do with heatmaps and recordings - but it needs existing traffic, and it does not diagnose why a page fails to convert. If your headline does not match your ad, Hotjar shows people leaving; it does not name the message-match failure. Nebula diagnoses that structure on any URL, free, with no traffic required."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-xs text-accent","children":"Read the pricing breakdown →"}]]}],["$","$L2","semrush-pricing",{"href":"/pricing-guides/semrush-pricing","className":"group rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-fg-muted","children":"Technical SEO platform"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-fg group-hover:text-accent transition-colors","children":["SEMrush Site Audit"," Pricing"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"SEMrush Pro costs $139.95/month and includes Site Audit as one module inside a full SEO platform. It runs 130+ technical SEO checks across a whole site - crawl errors, broken links, metadata - but it does not check conversion structure. A landing page that is not converting paid traffic will pass a SEMrush crawl while the real problem (headline mismatch, weak CTA, missing trust) stays invisible. Nebula checks the conversion layer for free, with a $97 one-time fix kit."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-xs text-accent","children":"Read the pricing breakdown →"}]]}],["$","$L2","unbounce-pricing",{"href":"/pricing-guides/unbounce-pricing","className":"group rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-6 transition-colors hover:border-accent","children":["$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]}]]}]]}]
d:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-14 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Why pricing matters when you are bleeding ad spend"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"A founder running paid traffic to a page that does not convert is paying twice: the ad cost every day, and a subscription for a tool that does not diagnose the actual problem. Before you add a recurring bill, run a free conversion audit. If the leak is message match, CTA, or trust - the most common causes - no heatmap or SEO crawl will name it. The fix is usually a one-time change, not a monthly platform."}]]}]
