22:Ta45,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the cheapest landing page audit tool?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Nebula (free audit, no signup, $97 optional one-time fix kit), Google PageSpeed Insights (free), and HubSpot Website Grader (free but email-gated, homepage only) are the free options. Screaming Frog is free up to 500 URLs, then £199/year. Hotjar has a free tier limited to 35 sessions per day."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which landing page audit tools require a subscription?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Hotjar (from $32/month), Crazy Egg (from $49/month), Unbounce (from $29/month, $249/month for Smart Traffic), and SEMrush (from $139.95/month) are subscription-based. Nebula is free for the audit with a one-time $97 fix kit - no subscription."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a free alternative to Crazy Egg or Hotjar?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes - Nebula audits any public landing page for free, with no signup and no traffic required. The difference: Nebula checks conversion structure (message match, CTA, trust, above-fold) rather than showing behavior heatmaps, which need existing visitor sessions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Unbounce pricing worth it for a single landing page?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Usually not. Unbounce starts at $29/month and only optimizes pages built inside its platform - the AI Smart Traffic feature that justifies the price requires the $249/month tier. For an existing page, a free conversion audit with a $97 one-time fix kit is the higher-leverage first step."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why is SEMrush $139.95/month?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"SEMrush is a full SEO platform - keyword research, rank tracking, competitor analysis, plus Site Audit as one module. If you only need to know why one landing page is not converting paid traffic, you are paying for a platform you will not use. A conversion audit checks the actual problem for free."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do any of these tools check conversion structure, not just speed or SEO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Only Nebula checks 9 observable conversion conditions on the public page: headline message match against the ad, CTA clarity, trust/social proof, above-fold structure, mobile CTA, load speed, ad signals, SEO foundations, and AI citation readiness. Those checks do not predict conversion from paid traffic. PageSpeed checks speed; Hotjar and Crazy Egg show behavior; SEMrush and Screaming Frog check technical SEO."}}]}f:["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$22"}}]
